# Runtime state, never build input. `COPY . .` in the build stage was uploading
# data/credentials.json — an operator credential store held in cleartext — into
# the ACR build service on every deploy. The runtime stage copies only .output,
# so it never reached the published image, but there is no reason to send it.
# data/social_cache.json* is fabricated records mentioning real individuals and
# is barred from leaving this machine (DPDP Act 2023) for the same reason
# .gitignore blocks it.
data/
